{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/",
    "description": [
      "汇总一组 FILE 的磁盘占用，对目录递归处理。"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "--all",
      "alias": [
        "-a"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-a, --all"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "统计所有文件，而不只是目录"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--apparent-size",
      "tip": [
        "打印表观大小而不是磁盘占用；表观大小通常更小，但可能因稀疏文件中的空洞、内部碎片、间接块等原因而更大"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--block-size",
      "alias": [
        "-B"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-B, --block-size <SIZE>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印前按 SIZE 缩放大小；例如 '-BM' 以 1,048,576 字节为单位打印；SIZE 的格式参见下方"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "E"
        },
        {
          "name": "EB"
        },
        {
          "name": "G"
        },
        {
          "name": "GB"
        },
        {
          "name": "GiB"
        },
        {
          "name": "K"
        },
        {
          "name": "KB"
        },
        {
          "name": "KiB"
        },
        {
          "name": "M"
        },
        {
          "name": "MB"
        },
        {
          "name": "MiB"
        },
        {
          "name": "P"
        },
        {
          "name": "PB"
        },
        {
          "name": "T"
        },
        {
          "name": "TB"
        },
        {
          "name": "Y"
        },
        {
          "name": "YB"
        },
        {
          "name": "Z"
        },
        {
          "name": "ZB"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--bytes",
      "alias": [
        "-b"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-b, --bytes"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "等同于 '--apparent-size --block-size=1'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--count-links",
      "alias": [
        "-l"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-l, --count-links"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "硬链接的文件重复计入大小"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--dereference",
      "alias": [
        "-L"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-L, --dereference"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "跟随所有符号链接"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--dereference-args",
      "alias": [
        "-D",
        "-H"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-D, -H, --dereference-args"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "只跟随命令行上列出的符号链接",
        "等同于 --dereference-args (-D)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--exclude",
      "usage": [
        "--exclude <PATTERN>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "排除匹配 PATTERN 的文件"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--exclude-from",
      "alias": [
        "-X"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-X, --exclude-from <FILE>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "排除与 FILE 中任一模式匹配的文件"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--files0-from",
      "usage": [
        "--files0-from <F>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "汇总文件 F 中以 NUL 结尾的文件名的磁盘占用；如果 F 是 -，则从标准输入读取文件名"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--human-readable",
      "alias": [
        "-h"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-h, --human-readable"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "以便于阅读的格式打印大小（例如 1K 234M 2G）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--inodes",
      "tip": [
        "列出 inode 使用信息而不是块使用信息"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--max-depth",
      "alias": [
        "-d"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-d, --max-depth <N>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "仅当目录（或配合 --all 的文件）在命令行参数之下 N 层或以内时才打印其总计；--max-depth=0 等同于 --summarize"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "0"
        },
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--no-dereference",
      "alias": [
        "-P"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-P, --no-dereference"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "不跟随任何符号链接（这是默认行为）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--null",
      "alias": [
        "-0"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-0, --null"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "每行输出以 NUL 结尾，而不是换行符"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--one-file-system",
      "alias": [
        "-x"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-x, --one-file-system"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "跳过位于其他文件系统上的目录"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--separate-dirs",
      "alias": [
        "-S"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-S, --separate-dirs"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "对目录不包含其子目录的大小"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--si",
      "tip": [
        "与 -h 类似，但使用 1000 的幂而不是 1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--summarize",
      "alias": [
        "-s"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-s, --summarize"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "只显示每个参数的总计"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--threshold",
      "alias": [
        "-t"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-t, --threshold <SIZE>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "SIZE 为正时排除小于它的条目，为负时排除大于它的条目"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "-1M"
        },
        {
          "name": "1K"
        },
        {
          "name": "1M"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--time",
      "usage": [
        "--time[=WORD]"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "显示该目录及其任意子目录中任意文件最后的修改时间",
        "以 WORD 代替修改时间显示时间：atime、access、use、ctime 或 status"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "access"
        },
        {
          "name": "atime"
        },
        {
          "name": "ctime"
        },
        {
          "name": "status"
        },
        {
          "name": "use"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--time-style",
      "usage": [
        "--time-style <STYLE>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "以 STYLE 风格显示时间，可以是 full-iso、long-iso、iso 或 +FORMAT；FORMAT 的解释方式与 'date' 相同"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "full-iso"
        },
        {
          "name": "iso"
        },
        {
          "name": "long-iso"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--total",
      "alias": [
        "-c"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-c, --total"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "给出总计"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "-k",
      "tip": [
        "等同于 --block-size=1K"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "-m",
      "tip": [
        "等同于 --block-size=1M"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "global_option": [
    {
      "name": "--help",
      "tip": [
        "显示此帮助并退出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--version",
      "tip": [
        "输出版本信息并退出"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
